B.a56=new A.iR("What this notice covers","This notice explains what information the StockSense free trial stores and why. The trial lets you explore StockSense without creating an account.")
B.a52=new A.iR("What we store","When you start the free trial we create an anonymous workspace for you. We do not ask for your name, email address or phone number to start. We store the items, stock movements, photos and settings you enter, a technical identifier for your anonymous account, and the date your trial started. The trial start date is also kept in your browser so that the 14-day period continues if you leave and come back.")
B.a59=new A.iR("Sample data","Your workspace begins with a fictional sample shop so you can try the app. It is not real data and you can clear it at any time.")
B.a57=new A.iR("Where it is stored","Workspace data is stored on Google Firebase services operated for Cloudora.")
B.a5b=new A.iR("Information you choose to send us","If you use the feedback form or ask for a consultation or an upgrade, we receive the details you submit and use them to reply to you. The feedback form is hosted by Google Forms.")
B.a5c=new A.iR("Your choices","You can edit or delete your items and clear the sample data at any time inside the app. To ask a question about your trial data, or to ask for it to be deleted, contact us at stocksense@cloudora.live.")
B.a53=new A.iR("Changes","We may update this notice. The date at the top of the page shows when it was last changed.")
